  "prompt": "Which products had a resent line in store BE-14's orders of June 2024, and how many units of each did BE-14 sell that month once the copies are removed? These tables may hold errors. Some of store BE-14's order lines were resent under a new order_line_id: two lines are copies of one order line when order_id, product_id, quantity and unit_price_eur all match. Keep the copy with the lowest order_line_id. June 2024 means order_ts, as stored, from 1 June 2024 up to but not including 1 July 2024. Return two columns, in this order: product_id and units (the quantity summed over BE-14's June 2024 lines of the product, copies removed). Return one row for each product with at least one resent line in those orders. Any row order is fine.",
